Type: Package
Package: densmix
Title: Fit Density Mixture Models Using EM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksandrs", "Gehsbargs", , "your-email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits density mixtures using the expectation-maximization
    algorithm.  It also provides functions for data simulation and
    visualization of fitted models.  Two mixture models are supported (a)
    one-dimensional mixtures of exponential and normal distributions and
    (b) mixtures of multinomials.
